These files provide two chunkings of the human genome b38.

  4cM/   - Small chunks for phase_rare (chr1-22, chrX)
  20cM/  - Large chunks for phase_common (chr1-22, chrX)

Each file contains 4 columns:
1. Chunk index
2. Chromosome/contig ID
3. Chunk coordinates including right and left buffers. These overlap with flanking chunks. 
4. Chunk coordinates NOT including right and left buffers. These do NOT overlap with flanking chunks.

Notes:
* Feed --region of phase_common with (3)
* Feed --scaffold-region of phase_rare with (3) 
* Feed --input-region of phase_rare with (4)
